<title>UK: BTR says to sell hda forgings to mbo team.</title>
<headline>BTR says to sell hda forgings to mbo team.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTR Plc said it had agreed to sell HDA Forgings to a management buyout team backed by NatWest Ventures for &quot;a price substantially in excess of net assets,&quot; which it said were around 17 million stg.</p>
<p>BTR said the sale was part of its ongoing disposal programme.  </p>
<p>BTR said in a statement that HDA Forgings made specialist titanium, aluminium steel and nickel alloy forgings for use in aerospace and defence.</p>
<p>BTR said revenues totalled 27 million stg in the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44171 542 7717</p>
